      "content": "i guess. i just feel like i'm stuck in this loop. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i didn't have to wake up and do it all again tomorrow. if there was just a way to finally be done with the noise, the pain, everything. like, does it actually matter if i'm still here?",
